    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Your Video Quality to Super Resolution with AI!   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nero AI Video Upscaler is your ultimate tool for enhancing videos up to 4x their original quality. If you're a content creator, marketer, work with AI-generated videos, or simply someone seeking to enhance old or low-quality videos, this Windows software is what you've been waiting for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Resolution: Enhance videos to 2x or 4x their original quality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noise Reduction: Remove noise and grain, ensuring your videos are crystal clear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Selection: Enhance any clip within a video without the need for pre-cutting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Frame Rate Interpolation: Fill the video by AI generated frames to increase the smoothness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Slow Motion: Create smooth slow-motion video from regular footage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Models for Every Need:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast - Upscale quickly, perfect for time-sensitive projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation - Recommended for animation and AI-generated content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic - Enhance actual video footage for true-to-life quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile - Reduce artifacts and increase clarity. </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Video Input: 1920*1080 and achieve amazing 4x video quality with it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Watermarks </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance Your Video Quality to Super Resolution with AI!   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nero AI Video Upscaler is your ultimate tool for enhancing videos up to 4x their original quality. If you're a content creator, marketer, work with AI-generated videos, or simply someone seeking to enhance old or low-quality videos, this Windows software is what you've been waiting for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Resolution: Enhance videos to 2x or 4x their original quality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noise Reduction: Remove noise and grain, ensuring your videos are crystal clear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Selection: Enhance any clip within a video without the need for pre-cutting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Frame Rate Interpolation: Fill the video by AI generated frames to increase the smoothness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Slow Motion: Create smooth slow-motion video from regular footage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Models for Every Need:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast - Upscale quickly, perfect for time-sensitive projects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation - Recommended for animation and AI-generated content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic - Enhance actual video footage for true-to-life quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versatile - Reduce artifacts and increase clarity. </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Video Input: 1920*1080 and achieve amazing 4x video quality with it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Watermarks </p></li></ul>",
